# ring-count

The `sparse_wake_ring` workload from `benches/scheduler.rs`, run once per ring size against scope 0.3.1,
printing rounds and polls.

    cd proofs/ring-count && cargo run --release

    links=10 rounds=201 polls=2010 polls_per_round=10
    links=100 rounds=21 polls=2100 polls_per_round=100
    links=1000 rounds=3 polls=3000 polls_per_round=1000

Every round polls every link, so the bench is not the "one runnable task among many idle ones" its
comment describes.
